    "description": "Precipitation data, updated every 5, 10 and 60 minutes and available for the last 14 days. The PRECIP product is the baseline weather radar product for precipitation estimation at ground. It combines the data from all five C-band Swiss weather radar stations. The PRECIP-SV product is a version of the PRECIP product with additional \"Side-View\" (SV) to visualize the vertical cross-sections along the x- and y-axis. The CombiPrecip (CPC) product combines in real-time the precipitation information from the weather radar network with the MeteoSwiss ground stations (rain-gauges).",
